## Key Insights

1. **OAuth is transparent**: Token refresh happens automatically in `getApiKeyForModel()`, user never sees it
2. **Session continuity**: Every sender gets their own session with full conversation history
3. **Skills are injected**: All 28 SKILL.md files go into Claude's system prompt
4. **Streaming is real-time**: Typing indicators update as Claude streams responses
5. **Tool execution is sandboxed**: Commands run in workspace directory with configurable timeouts
6. **Queue modes prevent chaos**: "interrupt" mode (WhatsApp default) aborts in-progress runs when new message arrives
7. **Token usage is tracked**: Per-session metrics help understand context window usage
8. **System events provide context**: New sessions get provider status, queued events (model switches, etc.)

