## Risk Mitigation

### Risk 1: Pi Library Doesn't Support Copilot Fully
**Mitigation**: Phase 1 investigation will confirm. If needed, implement custom fetch wrapper (see OpenCode's plugin pattern).

### Risk 2: API Format Incompatibility
**Mitigation**: OpenCode already bridges OpenAI ↔ Anthropic formats. We can reuse their transformation logic if Pi doesn't handle it.

### Risk 3: Token Refresh Failures
**Mitigation**: Implement retry logic with exponential backoff. Log failures to gateway logs. Show clear error in UI with re-auth link.

