- Set `DISCORD_BOT_TOKEN` or `discord.token` (env wins).
- Optional: set `discord.requireMention`, `discord.allowFrom`, or `discord.mediaMaxMb` as needed.

```json5
{
  discord: {
    token: "1234abcd"
  }
}
